*.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Scrub the Apple Developer team ID out of the Xcode project before it is
# committed. Xcode re-stamps DEVELOPMENT_TEAM into project.pbxproj on every
# IDE build (automatic signing writes it at the target level). The `strip-team`
# clean filter rewrites those values to "" on staging, so the team ID stays in
# the local working tree — signing keeps working — but never lands in git.
#
# The filter is registered per-clone (not carried in the repo): run
# ./scripts/setup-git-filters.sh after cloning.
StrayScanner.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj filter=strip-team
